k-icon" width="6" height="10" viewbox="0 0 6 10" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="6.88211" height="0.878125" transform="matrix(-0.707107 -0.707107 -0.707107 0.707107 5.48926 9.10327)" fill="black"></rect><rect y="4.86658" width="6.88211" height="0.878125" transform="rotate(-45 0 4.86658)" fill="black"></rect></svg><span class="header-nav-mobile-back-text"></span></button><div class="header-nav-mobile-panel" style="transform:translateX(100%);"><ul class="header-nav-mobile-list"><!--[--><li class="header-nav-mobile-item"><button class="header-nav-mobile-link">Solutions</button></li><li class="header-nav-mobile-item"><button class="header-nav-mobile-link">Developers</button></li><li class="header-nav-mobile-item"><button class="header-nav-mobile-link">Explore</button></li><li class="header-nav-mobile-item"><button class="header-nav-mobile-link">Learn</button></li><!--]--></ul></div><div class="header-nav-mobile-subpanel" style="opacity:1;transform:translateX(100%);"><ul class="header-nav-submenu"><!--[--><!--]--></ul></div></nav></div></header><main id="main" role="main" tabindex="-1"><!--[--><div></div><div class="page page-home"><h1 class="sr-only">Eigen Cloud</h1><div class="rubiks-experience"><div class="rubiks-canvas"></div><!--[--><div class="story-section section-hero"><div class="section-hero-inner"><h1 class="section-hero-title" aria-label="Verifiable cloud for the Agentic Era"><!--[--><span class="section-hero-line"><!--[--><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px) translateY(-100px);">Verifiable</span><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(-100px) translateY(-100px);">cloud</span><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) translateY(-50px);">for</span><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) translateY(-50px);">the</span><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) translateY(-50px);">Agentic</span><span class="section-hero-word" style="opacity:0;transform:translateX(50px) translateY(-50px);">Era</span><!--]--></span><!--]--></h1><div class="section-hero-measure" style="" aria-hidden="true"><!--[--><span class="section-hero-word">Verifiable</span><span class="section-hero-word">cloud</span><span class="section-hero-word">for</span><span class="section-hero-word">the</span><span class="section-hero-word">Agentic</span><span class="section-hero-word">Era</span><!--]--></div><div class="section-hero-body" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px);"><p>Build apps and agents your users can trust.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-hero-cta" href="https://docs.eigencloud.xyz/?utm_source=eigencloud.xyz&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_content=hero" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Start building now<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card"><div class="section-text-card-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-heading">AI can&#39;t scale if agents can&#39;t be trusted</h2><p class="section-text-card-text">As agents take on higher stakes tasks, user trust and agent accountability become critical. With EigenCloud, you can build agents that perform exactly as promised. It is the compute foundation for the agentic economy.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-text-card-cta" href="https://docs.eigencloud.xyz/?utm_source=eigencloud.xyz&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_content=trust" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Start building now<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card"><div class="section-text-card-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-heading">The developer platform for fully trusted apps and agents</h2><p class="section-text-card-text">Add cryptographic trust to any application with four powerful primitives. EigenCloud lets you add verifiability to data, computation, and inference backed by billions of dollars of slashable stake on EigenLayer.</p><!----></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card-side is-left"><div class="section-text-card-side-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-side-heading">EigenCompute</h2><p class="section-text-card-side-text">Add cryptographic trust to any application with zero code changes. Run any code, in any language, on any chain.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-text-card-side-cta" href="http://eigencloud.xyz/compute" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Explore EigenCompute<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card-side is-right"><div class="section-text-card-side-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-side-heading">EigenAI</h2><p class="section-text-card-side-text">AI results you can prove. Deterministic inference with drop-in OpenAI API compatibility.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-text-card-side-cta" href="http://eigencloud.xyz/ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Explore EigenAI<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card-side is-left"><div class="section-text-card-side-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-side-heading">EigenDA</h2><p class="section-text-card-side-text">Tamper-resistant data availability at scale. High throughput and sub-second confirmations for rollups and applications.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-text-card-side-cta" href="http://eigencloud.xyz/da" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Explore EigenDA<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-text-card-side is-right"><div class="section-text-card-side-inner" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-text-card-side-heading">EigenLayer</h2><p class="section-text-card-side-text">The trust layer. Stake ETH &amp; EIGEN. Secure the cloud powering verifiable apps, agents, and services. Earn rewards.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-text-card-side-cta" href="http://eigencloud.xyz/eigenlayer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Explore EigenLayer<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-logoCards"><div class="section-logoCards-inner"><div class="section-logoCards-header" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-logoCards-heading">Support for any use case</h2><p class="section-logoCards-text">Whether it&#39;s secure rollups, safer DeFi, or verifiable AI, EigenCloud gives you the primitives to support a wide range of use cases</p></div><div class="section-logoCards-cards"><!--[--><div class="section-logoCards-card" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><div class="section-logoCards-card-index">01</div><h3 class="section-logoCards-card-heading">Insured DeFi</h3><p class="section-logoCards-card-text">Protocol-level guarantees that make users whole when terms are breached. Powering cross-chain messaging and bridging like LayerZero.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-logoCards-card-cta" href="https://blog.eigencloud.xyz/eigenzero-layerzero-eigencloud/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Case Study<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="section-logoCards-card-icon"><svg width="148" height="40" viewBox="0 0 148 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g clip-path="url(#clip0_611_1559)">
