</div></div><div class="section-logoCards-card" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><div class="section-logoCards-card-index">02</div><h3 class="section-logoCards-card-heading">Sovereign Agents</h3><p class="section-logoCards-card-text">AI agents that can think, act, prove their actions across inference and execution, and take payment from humans and other agents. Powering Coinbase&#39;s AgentKit.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-logoCards-card-cta" href="https://blog.eigencloud.xyz/eigencloud-brings-verifiable-ai-to-mass-market-with-eigenai-and-eigencompute-launches/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Case Study<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="section-logoCards-card-icon"><svg width="224" height="40" viewBox="0 0 224 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
