</div></div><div class="section-logoCards-card" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><div class="section-logoCards-card-index">03</div><h3 class="section-logoCards-card-heading">Agentic Finance</h3><p class="section-logoCards-card-text">Verifiable agent-to-agent transactions at global scale. Cross-chain payments with cryptographic guarantees. Powering Google&#39;s A2A protocol.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-logoCards-card-cta" href="https://blog.eigencloud.xyz/eigencloud-partners-with-google/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Opens in new tab"><!--[-->Case Study<!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></div><div class="section-logoCards-card-icon"><svg width="121" height="40" viewBox="0 0 121 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
