</div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-wordCloud"><div class="section-wordCloud-inner"><div class="section-wordCloud-header" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-wordCloud-heading">Build trust into any app</h2><p class="section-wordCloud-text">From DeFi protocols to autonomous agents to rollup infrastructure, developers are using EigenCloud to ship applications with cryptographic trust built in.</p></div><div class="section-wordCloud-cloud" style="--wordCloud-pad-x:16px;--wordCloud-pad-y:5px;--wordCloud-gap:64px;--wordCloud-slide-ms:320ms;"><div class="section-wordCloud-board" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div><div class="story-section section-imgCards"><div class="section-imgCards-inner"><div class="section-imgCards-header" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><h2 class="section-imgCards-heading">Build with the verifiable cloud</h2><p class="section-imgCards-text">Get started with a word-class developer experience to build and deploy fully trusted apps and agents in minutes.</p><div class="cta-group"><!--[--><!--[--><a class="section-imgCards-cta" href="https://docs.eigencloud.xyz/?utm_source=eigencloud.xyz&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_content=build">Start building now</a><!--]--><!--]--></div></div><div class="section-imgCards-cards"><!--[--><div class="section-imgCards-card w-33" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(5rem);"><div class="section-imgCards-card-image"><div class="media image" data-orientation="portrait" style=""><img class="lazyload" data-srcset="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fqkdy2l3/production/223588e0039cc3cbe65a073c1b55bc7b93eed6d6-931x1253.jpg?w=400&amp;q=90&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 400w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fqkdy2l3/production/223588e0039cc3cbe65a073c1b55bc7b93eed6d6-931x1253.jpg?w=600&amp;q=90&amp;auto=format&amp;dpr=1.5 600w, https://cdn.sanity.io/images/fqkdy2l3/production/223588e0039cc3cbe65a073c1b55bc7b93eed6d6-931x1253.jpg?w=800&amp;q=90&amp;auto=